{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"9557","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v2406","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"佐野俊英(さのとしひで、さぬ)","creatorId":"vndb:s1121","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:10","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1121","name":"佐野俊英(さのとしひで、さぬ)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:37349","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"マ・タロー","creatorId":"egs:creator:2221","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2221","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2221","name":"マ・タロー","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:37350","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"筒井香織(tutti)","creatorId":"vndb:s1117","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2689","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1117","name":"筒井香織(tutti)","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:37351","source":"egs"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"佐野 俊英","creatorId":"vndb:s1121","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1121","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1121","name":"佐野 俊英","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:34701","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11712","characterName":"楠木 巴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11712"},"originalCharacterName":"楠木 巴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is serious, strict, and kind. She is also very friendly with her neighbors, who come to her for advice on their problems, as well as with the main character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She sometimes makes mischievous mistakes, but she is able to get out of them with her natural wit. She is a woman who can love without compensation, who understands the meaning of sacrificial love, and who does it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But perhaps her kindness comes from her sense of responsibility. Throughout her life, her purpose in life is to do everything she can for her son."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has never had any experience with men because she has never had any contact with men outside of work (she intentionally avoids them)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11712"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09628d9148511a479f0bbfccb553b5f59c857bbe126f098a2342407d142d16c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f603534e0b6a9c6ed61e83d39fd2f7cbf9fc0ff361706a7906e29b3f3a995e08.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"まき いづみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18522","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11713","characterName":"楠木 茜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11713"},"originalCharacterName":"楠木 茜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She disappeared shortly after the protagonist was born (or so we are told)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Recently, Akane reunites with the protagonist through an artificially mistaken e-mail. Did the protagonist, who knew nothing about her, see an image of his “mother” in her when he met her for the first time?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Or was it purely his interest in women which started his physical relationship with Akane."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Akane's point of view, there was a part of her that was not even allowed to see her son. Perhaps her smoldering affection burst and she could no longer stand it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But either way, the way she loved him was distorted. No matter the methods, her desire to seek out the protagonist is apparent."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11713"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbabeb1875d7c09f8f14e84d68a50edcd677ed89bf7fa30a4dd5991f7176b81c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0342d211c96c53c236ba00ed4564a9fd3f103a682133bd8f917dc5dbcbfdcd8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"堂本 あかり","creatorId":"vndb:s7521","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7521","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7521","name":"堂本 あかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18523","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11714","characterName":"君島 夕子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11714"},"originalCharacterName":"君島 夕子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A married woman who lives next door, has known the main character since she was a child. To my mother, she is a close neighbor, almost like a “fellow wife”."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is one of the few people who knows what is going on at the main character's house. She masturbates heavily at night, probably because her husband is on a long business trip."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since the main character's room is next to hers across the wall, her voice often leaks out. He struggles, as he tries to concentrate on his studies while wearing headphones."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11714"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/18fd0e29fbbe385be34218e5807c1873c4211c4bd1eb12650bd0953bfe0a8f7c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/543585b9788e0874813befed3dbf26643c2eff6a7020e8ae53cee6091bfba1b7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"児玉 さとみ","creatorId":"vndb:s115","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s115","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s115","name":"児玉 さとみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18521","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c68236","characterName":"楠木 実","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c68236"},"originalCharacterName":"楠木 実","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is an ordinary young man who can be found anywhere."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has no father, but he has lived a slow life with his mother without worrying about that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, due to a reunion with Akane, who is said to be his birth mother, and a breakdown of trust with Tomoe, he loses the “reality” inside him after repeated changes in the truth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Within the protagonist, something that had been suppressed until now comes to the surface."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c68236"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p286","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1019","canonic